---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';import ButtonLink from '../components/ButtonLink.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="Meet Evan and learn why Calypso Digital Studio combines thoughtful design with practical software development."><PageIntro eyebrow="About the studio" title="A personal design studio with the technical range to build more than a brochure site." description="I work directly with business owners to turn unclear ideas, scattered information, and inefficient workflows into understandable digital experiences."/><section class="about container"><div><h2>Design and development belong in the same conversation.</h2><p>I started Calypso Digital Studio to help small businesses get websites that feel like their actual business while still working clearly for customers. The same approach extends into custom tools when a standard website cannot solve the whole problem.</p><p>The studio is based in New York's Capital Region and can work with clients anywhere.</p></div><figure class="surface"><img src="/assets/brand/calypso-master.webp" alt="Calypso Digital Studio illustrated logo" width="1200" height="1200"/><figcaption>The studio is named after Calypso. Her markings and personality influence the warm, organic identity without turning the business into a novelty brand.</figcaption></figure></section><section class="principles container"><p class="eyebrow">Studio principles</p><div><article><h2>Understandable</h2><p>Clients should not need development vocabulary to explain what their business needs.</p></article><article><h2>Purpose-built</h2><p>Pages and features should exist because they serve the business or its customers.</p></article><article><h2>Honest</h2><p>Project status, limitations, recommendations, and next steps should always be clear.</p></article></div><ButtonLink href="/start">Start Your Project</ButtonLink></section></BaseLayout><style>.about{display:grid;gap:var(--space-6);align-items:center}.about figure{margin:0;overflow:hidden}.about figcaption{padding:var(--space-4)}.principles{padding-block:var(--space-8)}.principles>div{display:grid;gap:var(--space-4);margin-bottom:var(--space-5)}@media(min-width:56rem){.about{grid-template-columns:1fr .8fr}.principles>div{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))}}</style>
